crisis_intro:
If the channel is under attack (a leaked link, a rogue admin, a raid), crisis mode does everything at once:
• revokes the links made through Aegis and makes a new primary link;
• declines new join requests;
• holds every post for approval and puts back late edits;
• demotes the admins appointed through Aegis (not you, not the owner);
• locks the discussion group.
«End crisis» brings back the settings, re-appoints those admins with their rights and unlocks the group (the old links stay revoked).
